 & 7 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & -8 & 8 \\\\ -6 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186385939 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ecdc6a5a-5aba-5547-97aa-db3cd2e90ae6" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9acfcef4-0fac-55cf-894a-84c49c321306" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ -5 & 3 & 8 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 2 & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385941} {:answer/id #uuid "9cb5e120-ca8c-5280-8d71-9e5d6b77f067" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 3 & 4 & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385942} {:answer/id #uuid "04801655-1afc-57c1-8799-2964adf7a4f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & \\sqrt{5} & 8 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 8 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 3 & 2 & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385943} {:answer/id #uuid "2fefabec-9f8b-5b5b-8ee0-2aa69b82e8cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & \\sqrt{5} & 5 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 3 & 8\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385944} {:answer/id #uuid "cf56b303-d38b-59da-b564-2e9e9bd2c8fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 7 & 3 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385945}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9cb5e120-ca8c-5280-8d71-9e5d6b77f067" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 3 & 4 & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385942} :answer-field/id #uuid "205ad0d6-ce74-5615-bb05-5089fc7c18