-2 & 0 & ∗ \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 & ∗ \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 & ∗ \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{15}=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cofactor of ${d}_{15}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{15} & =(-1)^{1+5}{M}_{15} \\\\  & ={M}_{15} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120138 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8cf96559-d15d-5d46-b82e-9867f3e76df1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "80" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117349} {:answer/id #uuid "a25cc8da-6ff1-541d-a96e-66eae2c114c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "112" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117350} {:answer/id #uuid "b82e2f65-4085-5175-a78b-20b556a9c38a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117351} {:answer/id #uuid "5dbf0618-2132-58b4-9703-272d5f42d3d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117352} {:answer/id #uuid "773387ba-b154-57c6-a1c4-ceb00c7c5023" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-112" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117353}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a25cc8da-6ff1-541d-a96e-66eae2c114c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "112" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117350} :answer-field/id #uuid "aee1001c-2f5c-513d-b935-0a31bb7db095" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117348}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4807bb32-2a62-536d-a90f-b629a70d8fa6" :question/math-academy-id "q-32800" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}]$" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & ={a}_{11}{C}_{11}+{a}_{12}{C}_{12}+{a}_{13}{C}_{13}+{a}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =0\\cdot {C}_{11}+8\\cdot {C}_{12}+0\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =8{C}_{12} \\\\  & =8\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & 8 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ -1 & ∗ & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & 6 & 2 \\\\ 1 & ∗ & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =8(-1)^{1+2}|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-8((-1)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 6 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =8(6\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 2)-0+0 \\\\  & =8\\cdot 14 \\\\  & =112\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326430 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aeb1a24c-9e55-50ba-8ddb-52ab32da0658" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326432} {:answer/id #uuid "c0033cfc-f631-5db4-9d33-3e51d742e348" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326433} {:answer/id #uuid "f81c3fbc-9329-50cf-9fb2-61aafb3137c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326434} {:answer/id #uuid "4f1b72a1-f86b-5c21-81c2-1d4f874329fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326435} {:answer/id #uuid "cf0b953a-e3f9-5cfc-b762-164e75ae1084" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326436}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c0033cfc-f631-5db4-9d33-3e51d742e348" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326433} :answer-field/id #uuid "f9e4c8a0-b9b8-580d-b345-94c8ee59b01c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326431}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "dc203d1d-4257-5339-9a9d-96833ce028df" :question/math-academy-id "q-36043" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of ${b}_{34}$ in \n$B=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of ${b}_{34}$, we remove the $3$rd row and the $4$th column: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 3 & ∗ \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & -2 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 0 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{34}=|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cofactor of ${b}_{34}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{34} & =(-1)^{3+4}{M}_{34} \\\\  & =-{M}_{34} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309319 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "347ef0fd-a81d-53f9-92c4-f8d67ad6ec95" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "28" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309321} {:answer/id #uuid "6017ae45-a08f-543c-b5d0-52dff35ae102" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-62" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309322} {:answer/id #uuid "5b78316c-dd1e-5257-9c2a-e1ea54ad016d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-51" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309323} {:answer/id #uuid "931dc1f4-35c6-5465-bde2-cbd7472cd65e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "65" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309324} {:answer/id #uuid "c8050bf2-c812-508f-8b32-bec260e615c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "39" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309325}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6017ae45-a08f-543c-b5d0-52dff35ae102" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-62" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309322} :answer-field/id #uuid "66c3b9ce-36b7-5ca9-a937-b9ad6a3024e3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309320}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "847eae56-3846-5fab-8026-233085fa9f12" :question/math-academy-id "q-36045" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$Z=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(Z) & ={z}_{11}{C}_{11}+{z}_{12}{C}_{12}+{z}_{13}{C}_{13}+{z}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =1\\cdot {C}_{11}+0\\cdot {C}_{12}+(-1)\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & ={C}_{11}-{C}_{13} \\\\  & =1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ ∗ & -3 & 5 & 4 \\\\ ∗ & 4 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|+(-1)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & -1 & ∗ \\\\ 0 & 0 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & ∗ & 4 \\\\ 0 & 4 & ∗ & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-1)^{1+1}|\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|+(-1)\\cdot (-1)^{1+3}|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|-(-2)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-3 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}|)-(0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-3 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =0+2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-3 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{aligned}|+0-(0-0+0) \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-3 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2((-3)\\cdot 5-4\\cdot 4) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-31) \\\\  & =-62\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186385960 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a854e73a-8b29-5f86-8d48-3f2d7d22fa59" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-371" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385962} {:answer/id #uuid "98e41069-1511-55c3-9041-06e1d1e0d40d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "315" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385963} {:answer/id #uuid "f3a54f04-3935-5bf7-b165-fb8ca242ffcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "148" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385964} {:answer/id #uuid "a23d11bf-51d3-5b95-bbef-3da89187419f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-178" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385965} {:answer/id #uuid "0a0a5386-82d8-5130-8e03-8fb8f36be995" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "157" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385966}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f3a54f04-3935-5bf7-b165-fb8ca242ffcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "148" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385964} :answer-field/id #uuid "b0c7f10c-6be2-5ea6-a4b3-7415b93f2786" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385961}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "ba4d10c8-f4aa-5ade-bfd9-5e21efca3d20" :question/math-academy-id "q-36053" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$U=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 5 & -4\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(U) & ={u}_{11}{C}_{11}+{u}_{12}{C}_{12}+{u}_{13}{C}_{13}+{u}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =5\\cdot {C}_{11}+(-2)\\cdot {C}_{12}+0\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =5{C}_{11}-2{C}_{12} \\\\  & =5\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ ∗ & 6 & 0 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & 2 & 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|+(-2)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & -2 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ 0 & ∗ & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & ∗ & 5 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =5\\cdot (-1)^{1+1}|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|+(-2)\\cdot (-1)^{1+2}|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 5 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =5|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|+2|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 5 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =5(0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|-1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{aligned}|)+2(0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|-1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 5\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =5(0-(6\\cdot (-4)-1\\cdot 2)+0)+2(0-(3\\cdot (-4)-1\\cdot (-3))+0) \\\\  & =5\\cdot 26+2\\cdot 9 \\\\  & =130+18 \\\\  & =148\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186385967 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3fd1df0c-1614-5a56-ab50-c4d36ec71f83" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385969} {:answer/id #uuid "8002e732-8ef7-56b5-8feb-8e7f506cf5d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385970} {:answer/id #uuid "4215d53b-6d34-5063-8370-d988fb1ce7ee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & -5 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385971} {:answer/id #uuid "c1d9e740-7b6b-5a3a-98d0-b10ffb703df0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}-5 & 1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 & -7 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385972} {:answer/id #uuid "dfaed489-c38d-554e-a7c3-6520cff1255d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & -5 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385973}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8002e732-8ef7-56b5-8feb-8e7f506cf5d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385970} :answer-field/id #uuid "c70b75ba-2cc3-56fc-8547-f79cf16c58ec" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/ty